<div class="gallery-wrapper"><div class="gallery" data-translation="Add images" data-columns="1" data-is-empty="false">
<figure class="gallery__item"><a href="https://adroz78.com/media/posts/11/gallery/Wu-Ti-83_20261031223236.png" data-size="2048x1536"><img loading="lazy" src="https://adroz78.com/media/posts/11/gallery/Wu-Ti-83_20261031223236-thumbnail.png" alt="" width="768" height="576"></a></figure>
</div></div>
<p>AIC-RF/2 is malfunctioning again! I wonder what funny thing he'll—— oh. oh no. oh god.</p>
<p>It seems like he got into the role of acting like a living fox too much, and decided to violently kill his target, then eat their remains. It doesn't seem to faze him though, after all worrying about such things would decrease his efficiency, and he's not really aware of anything being "wrong" either. He might not even remember it, since the glitching might make it not properly save onto his hard drive. He'll snap out of it. Sooner or later.</p>
<p>Decided to draw a gore piece for Halloween, came out kinda shit because I had to rush myself, sorry for that. Still kinda happy with it, maybe I'll explore this kind of darker art sometime in the future. Happy (late) Halloween!</p>
            ]]>
