        <id>https://adroz78.com/posts/life-is-robloxxxxx/</id>
            <category term="my_art"/>

        <updated>2026-09-26T21:45:00+02:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                    <div class="gallery-wrapper"><div class="gallery" data-translation="Add images" data-columns="1" data-is-empty="false">
<figure class="gallery__item"><a href="https://adroz78.com/media/posts/13/gallery/LIFE-IS-ROBLOXXXXX_20261001225046.png" data-size="2048x2048"><img loading="lazy" src="https://adroz78.com/media/posts/13/gallery/LIFE-IS-ROBLOXXXXX_20261001225046-thumbnail.png" alt="" width="768" height="768"></a></figure>
</div></div>
<p>As that one cringe old TikTok sound went, "Life is Roblox". And just like life, Roblox is also very hard to draw. I drew this based on my Kanvas (old Roblox) avatar, the hardest part was figuring out the orientation of all these cubes. It's a weird mix of R6 and R15, I like this style of drawing Roblox avatars.<br><br></p>

                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                <div class="gallery-wrapper"><div class="gallery" data-translation="Add images" data-columns="1" data-is-empty="false">
<figure class="gallery__item"><a href="https://adroz78.com/media/posts/13/gallery/LIFE-IS-ROBLOXXXXX_20261001225046.png" data-size="2048x2048"><img loading="lazy" src="https://adroz78.com/media/posts/13/gallery/LIFE-IS-ROBLOXXXXX_20261001225046-thumbnail.png" alt="" width="768" height="768"></a></figure>
</div></div>
<p>As that one cringe old TikTok sound went, "Life is Roblox". And just like life, Roblox is also very hard to draw. I drew this based on my Kanvas (old Roblox) avatar, the hardest part was figuring out the orientation of all these cubes. It's a weird mix of R6 and R15, I like this style of drawing Roblox avatars.<br><br></p>

<p>I don't like this artstyle that much. I thought it would fit the sharp edges of Roblox but it doesn't. Every time I use this brush I get disappointed.. I should stop using it sometimes, hah</p>
            ]]>
        </content>
    </entry>
